{"id":"bessmyslenno","lemma":"бессмысленно","pos":"adv","rank":2269,"glosses":["senselessly; foolishly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BC%D1%8B%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BC%D1%8B%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это было бы бессмысленно.","en":"It would be pointless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283290","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"would"},null]},{"text":"То, что он говорит, совершенно бессмысленно.","en":"What he says is total nonsense.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"perfectly"},null]},{"text":"Это бессмысленно сейчас обсуждать.","en":"There's no point discussing that now.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"now"},{"g":"to discuss"}]},{"text":"Всё бессмысленно.","en":"Nothing makes sense.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Об этом бессмысленно спорить.","en":"There's no use arguing about it.","words":[{"g":"about"},null,null,{"g":"to dispute, to argue"}]}]}